  <command:command>
    <command:details>
      <command:name>Update-PSSqlRepositoryEntity</command:name>
      <maml:description>
        <maml:para>Updates existing entities: a discoverable proxy for Save-PSSqlRepositoryEntity -Mode Update.</maml:para>
      </maml:description>
      <command:verb>Update</command:verb>
      <command:noun>PSSqlRepositoryEntity</command:noun>
    </command:details>
    <maml:description>
      <maml:para>Forwards every parameter to Save-PSSqlRepositoryEntity with -Mode Update, so an entity whose key does not exist yet fails instead of being inserted. Pipeline input, batching (-BatchSize), -IncludeNavigations, -OrphanBehavior and -PassThru behave exactly as on Save-PSSqlRepositoryEntity; see its help for details.</maml:para>
    </maml:description>
